WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:02.850
Bring it on, Akagami!

00:03.850 --> 00:06.650
Since you've already beaten 
Yuzuki-san and Tsukuyo-san...

00:06.650 --> 00:07.230
What?

00:07.760 --> 00:10.230
I shall save this temple!

00:10.230 --> 00:13.110
Mia, you seem confused.

00:13.110 --> 00:17.370
Don't worry. I'm long past 
asking Akagami to move out.

00:17.800 --> 00:20.760
Akagami, should you lose our duel...

00:22.280 --> 00:24.620
I'll castrate you.

00:26.440 --> 00:28.750
C-Castrate?

00:30.160 --> 00:32.840
