00:31.890 --> 00:34.010
What? You're on board with that?!

02:04.690 --> 02:07.530
Akagami-kun, look after things while I'm gone.

02:04.810 --> 02:08.850
<b>Episode 3: I'll Castrate You</b>

02:07.530 --> 02:08.980
Got it.

02:08.980 --> 02:11.000
Try to get along with Mia.

02:11.000 --> 02:12.430
Got it.

02:12.430 --> 02:14.600
