02:41.140 --> 02:42.640
Yes, Mia-san.

02:43.350 --> 02:45.340
You're using my first name already?

02:45.340 --> 02:47.390
Such a presumptuous man.

02:47.390 --> 02:49.630
I am Mia Christoph.

02:49.630 --> 02:54.150
