Show some respect for your senpai!

02:54.540 --> 02:56.820
We're in the same situation, then?

02:57.120 --> 02:58.650
The same situation?!

02:58.650 --> 03:04.540
H-How rude! I am earnestly doing 
my best to study Japanese culture at...

03:01.320 --> 03:03.260
My name is Kagura.

03:03.260 --> 03:04.540
How polite.

03:04.540 --> 03:05.660
