03:05.930 --> 03:09.230
I also live here as her attendant.

03:10.030 --> 03:12.030
Are you Mia-san's sister?

03:12.030 --> 03:13.600
Her older sister, yes.

03:13.600 --> 03:16.670
We're not sisters! And I'm older!

03:17.160 --> 03:21.120
By the way, Mia-san, 
why don't we call off this duel?

03:21.120 --> 03:23.220
What? Are you making fun of me?

03:23.220 --> 03:27.220
Don't tell me you forgot the atrocity
you committed when we first met!

03:29.680 --> 03:32.320
I hate your guts!

03:32.320 --> 03:34.740
I swear I'll castrate you!

03:41.000 --> 03:44.020
The "atrocity" I committed when we met?

03:51.620 --> 03:54.630
Um... What is this?

03:56.360 --> 03:58.130
Hyakunin Isshu.

03:59.270 --> 04:06.400
Long ago, a samurai killed one person 
to save the lives of a hundred people.

04:06.400 --> 04:10.760
And Hyakunin Isshu is a contest 
to determine who that one will be!

04:11.760 --> 04:13.390
It's the national sport of Japan!

04:13.390 --> 04:15.150
That's not the Japan I know!

04:15.150 --> 04:17.400
Okay, begin.

04:21.780 --> 04:24.760
<i>She's serious.</i>

04:25.650 --> 04:26.910
Ready your blade.

04:28.440 --> 04:30.160
The next one's cutting skin.

04:30.160 --> 04:35.500
<i>This is bad. But I can't hurt Mia-san.</i>

04:35.500 --> 04:38.420
Prepare yourself, Akagami!

04:40.090 --> 04:42.950
Secret bare-handed sword-stopping technique!

04:43.300 --> 04:44.590
<b>Total 
Amateur</b>

04:49.920 --> 04:51.180
Oh?

04:51.660 --> 04:53.180
My, my.

04:57.540 --> 05:01.110
<i>Her breasts... popped out?</i>

05:02.080 --> 05:04.110
Don't look!

05:05.000 --> 05:05.740
<i>Namusan!</i>

05:09.160 --> 05:10.420
<i>I... got them?</i>

05:13.410 --> 05:17.690
<i>They're... magnificent!</i>

05:24.150 --> 05:25.880
Mia-san!

05:25.880 --> 05:27.630
My, my.

05:27.630 --> 05:32.640
And that means Mia-san will be 
suffering through a penalty.

05:33.020 --> 05:35.520
Mia-san, you suck.

05:35.520 --> 05:38.650
But... my sarashi...

05:38.650 --> 05:42.430
Now then, Akagami-san, 
how should she be punished?

05:42.430 --> 05:43.710
I have to decide?

05:43.710 --> 05:46.650
In that case, I'll decide for you.

05:47.030 --> 05:47.700
<b>Collection
of
Penances</b>

05:47.890 --> 05:51.450
Every one of the world's most unusual 
ascetic practices can be found in this book.

05:51.450 --> 05:56.880
You'll select a method from this rare 
collection of penances to complete.

05:57.410 --> 06:00.540
<i>Collection of penances?</i>

06:00.540 --> 06:02.350
This one is agonizing.

06:02.350 --> 06:07.580
It involves inserting objects into all your 
orifices and enduring all kinds of things.

06:07.580 --> 06:09.630
A-All of them?

06:09.630 --> 06:10.760
Yes.

06:10.760 --> 06:12.060
All kinds of things?

06:12.060 --> 06:13.350
Yes.

06:13.760 --> 06:14.720
I'll do it!

06:14.720 --> 06:16.230
Don't do it!

06:16.230 --> 06:17.840
I don't need your pity!

06:17.840 --> 06:19.210
Please calm down!

06:19.210 --> 06:21.950
There's actually something else I'd prefer.

06:21.950 --> 06:22.860
What is it?

06:24.040 --> 06:25.900
What I want is...

06:28.810 --> 06:30.360
That.

06:34.740 --> 06:35.990
<b>Collection
of
Penances</b>

06:36.620 --> 06:38.000
<b>Collection
of
Penances</b>

06:36.790 --> 06:38.000
I want that.

06:38.740 --> 06:40.620
You want <i>that</i>?!

06:38.790 --> 06:40.620
<b>Boobs</b>

