06:49.760 --> 06:52.110
There are so many things I want to try!

06:52.110 --> 06:53.510
Try? Try what?!

06:53.510 --> 06:56.110
Just once. Please.

06:56.110 --> 06:58.270
No freaking way!

06:58.270 --> 07:00.640
You titty monster!

07:00.640 --> 07:01.900
My, my.

07:06.130 --> 07:10.460
