08:42.960 --> 08:44.140
Why? I mean...

08:44.960 --> 08:48.540
<i>The penalty... I see. I've figured it out.</i>

08:48.540 --> 08:50.550
You mustn't do this!

08:50.550 --> 08:51.340
Huh?

08:51.340 --> 08:54.670
I know you don't want to
relinquish the collection of penances,

08:54.670 --> 08:56.920
