09:19.410 --> 09:22.660
<i>Failure! Failure! My life's greatest failure!</i>

09:22.660 --> 09:27.670
<i>I can't believe I got confused 
and humiliated myself like that!</i>

09:29.640 --> 09:33.460
<i>What's a man doing at a nunnery, anyway?</i>

09:37.510 --> 09:40.060
<i>I'll hide inside the storage shed and meditate.</i>

09:43.560 --> 09:44.440
Hello.

09:44.440 --> 09:45.700
<i>He's in here?!</i>

09:45.700 --> 09:47.790
Kagura-san told me to meet you here.

09:47.790 --> 09:50.310
Damn it, Kagura!

09:50.670 --> 09:52.310
What are you doing here?

09:52.310 --> 09:54.330
What does it matter?

09:56.480 --> 09:58.820
What? No way!

10:00.680 --> 10:02.830
It won't open.

10:06.620 --> 10:08.840
We can't get out through the window.

10:09.830 --> 10:15.880
We don't have our phones, and I doubt 
anyone outside would hear us shouting.

10:16.670 --> 10:19.340
We might be stuck in here 
together until morning.

10:19.340 --> 10:20.840
Stay away from me, please.

10:28.660 --> 10:30.100
I found a blanket.

10:31.700 --> 10:32.400
