10:50.080 --> 10:51.880
It's called a sutra transcription desk.

10:52.280 --> 10:56.010
It's for displaying the heads of those 
who turn away from Buddha's teachings.

10:56.380 --> 10:57.640
Their heads?

10:57.640 --> 10:59.630
That's what Kagura told me.

11:00.230 --> 11:03.140
Your head will end up there eventually.

11:03.640 --> 11:06.650
I can't believe you joined a temple 
when you don't even know that.

11:10.640 --> 11:12.020
Would you like the blanket after all?

11:12.020 --> 11:13.850
I don't need it.

11:13.850 --> 11:15.680
It gets cold at night.

11:15.680 --> 11:16.530
Stay away!

11:16.650 --> 11:17.760
What if you catch a cold?

11:17.760 --> 11:18.780
Hey...

11:18.900 --> 11:20.430
Don't be so stubborn.

11:20.430 --> 11:22.110
I told you not to...

11:25.560 --> 11:30.300
If you get too close, you'll turn me on!

11:30.300 --> 11:31.140
Huh?

11:32.330 --> 11:36.000
<b>Nothing ventured, nothing gained.</b>

11:36.640 --> 11:38.580
T-Turn you on?

11:39.100 --> 11:41.510
Uh, no. That's not what I meant to say.

11:44.580 --> 11:48.390
