12:19.000 --> 12:23.380
And what happened in your room, too.

12:23.940 --> 12:25.680
You want me to forget that?

12:25.680 --> 12:27.860
That would be very difficult.

12:28.480 --> 12:32.310
I wish you'd said yes, 
even if you didn't mean it.

12:32.680 --> 12:37.340
