12:43.880 --> 12:47.530
No. That's the real me.

12:48.050 --> 12:54.650
Ever since I could remember, my true 
nature has clung to me like a curse.

12:56.530 --> 12:58.590
It's the reason I came to Japan.

12:58.590 --> 13:02.100
The reason you came to Japan?

13:02.100 --> 13:02.900
Yes.

13:04.130 --> 13:07.090
I hope you'll forget about this, too,

13:07.090 --> 13:12.100
but my family is known as an erotic family.

13:17.190 --> 13:21.110
