13:42.860 --> 13:44.590
I'm so excited.

13:44.590 --> 13:47.280
Will we be able to make a hundred friends?

13:47.280 --> 13:49.020
Will we, indeed...

13:49.640 --> 13:51.790
Ms. Mia, are you anxious?

13:51.790 --> 13:52.730
Yes.

13:53.420 --> 13:57.890
I'm not sure that I'll be able to find 
a hundred lovers like my mother.

13:59.730 --> 14:02.180
<i>And so, I ended up alone and friendless.</i>

14:04.560 --> 14:07.540
<i>By the time I realized something 
wasn't right, it was too late.</i>

14:08.210 --> 14:10.990
