15:17.360 --> 15:18.930
What?!

15:19.280 --> 15:21.440
You, too?

15:21.440 --> 15:24.840
I had no idea someone else 
suffered from the same circumstances.

15:24.840 --> 15:27.280
It's so hard, isn't it?

15:27.280 --> 15:28.780
It sure is!

15:31.320 --> 15:35.590
<i>What an incredible coincidence. 
No, this is fate.</i>

15:36.120 --> 15:39.510
<i>With him, maybe I could...</i>

15:42.150 --> 15:45.170
