15:50.200 --> 15:54.070
<i>I need to run away from Akagami 
and the Christoph family.</i>

15:55.650 --> 15:57.370
<i>I just have to keep running.</i>

15:58.680 --> 16:01.430
Let's fight it together, Mia-san!

16:02.470 --> 16:04.760
