18:00.630 --> 18:02.190
What is this?

18:02.190 --> 18:03.310
Ta-da.

18:03.600 --> 18:07.990
They've been grappling together all night long.

18:08.920 --> 18:11.340
All night long?

18:21.200 --> 18:24.330
Hey!

18:24.330 --> 18:25.120
<b>Repenting</b>

18:25.120 --> 18:26.200
<b>Repenting</b>

18:31.620 --> 18:33.340
Did something happen?

18:33.340 --> 18:36.460
I dunno. Are you mad?

18:36.780 --> 18:37.830
Not at all.

18:39.080 --> 18:40.650
By the way, Yuzuki.

18:40.650 --> 18:41.590
Yes?

18:41.590 --> 18:47.680
