20:31.520 --> 20:34.460
Akagami-kun, seriously, who <i>are</i> you?

20:39.630 --> 20:42.120
We're out of gas...

20:43.630 --> 20:45.130
Is that the bus?

20:44.380 --> 20:45.130
<b>Bus</b>

20:45.130 --> 20:46.390
Really?!

20:51.140 --> 20:53.390
<b>Black Bus
Transport
Company</b>

20:53.790 --> 20:58.650
What kind of idiot mistakes a truck for a bus?

20:58.650 --> 21:02.120
<i>Yuzuki-oneechan is a dumb perv.</i>

21:01.880 --> 21:04.620
Imaginary Third Daughter, stop.

21:02.120 --> 21:03.870
<i>She's useless and horny.</i>

21:03.870 --> 21:06.120
<i>Stupid, useless, and horny.</i>

21:06.120 --> 21:09.160
Who cares if she's horny? Stop it.

21:10.200 --> 21:14.830
I'm sorry, Akagami-kun. 
Your efforts were wasted.

21:16.400 --> 21:21.780
Maybe it's impossible for me 
to keep the temple open.

21:23.970 --> 21:25.170
Yuzuki-san...

21:29.630 --> 21:31.680
This is an opportunity for you to get changed.

21:32.110 --> 21:32.930
Huh?

21:33.360 --> 21:37.160
You'll get changed now, and we'll exit 
when we hit the next red light!

21:37.160 --> 21:38.480
But...

21:38.480 --> 21:40.690
We'll borrow this truck once we're out.

21:40.690 --> 21:44.190
I have truck-driving experience, too.

21:44.640 --> 21:46.450
Borrow it? How?

21:46.450 --> 21:48.350
We'll offer them money.

21:48.350 --> 21:50.660
You're already in debt, you know!

21:52.130 --> 21:53.610
I've got nothing to lose.

21:53.610 --> 21:55.980
Isn't that exactly the problem?

22:04.080 --> 22:05.170
Fine.

22:05.700 --> 22:10.140
All right! Let's get changed 
and break down that door!

22:10.140 --> 22:11.340
Got it!

22:12.060 --> 22:15.060
Matchmaking Meeting
in 30 Minutes

22:12.370 --> 22:13.630
No matter what happens...

22:13.630 --> 22:15.060
We won't give up!

23:45.020 --> 23:46.030
This is bad.

23:45.020 --> 24:00.040
<b>Next Time

Go Ahead and Take a Shower</b>

23:46.030 --> 23:47.130
What's the problem?

23:47.130 --> 23:50.300
Yuzu-nee is... She's in Ada...

23:50.300 --> 23:51.290
Adachi?

23:51.290 --> 23:55.310
No! She's at a lo... love...

23:55.310 --> 23:56.350
Love hotel!

23:56.350 --> 23:59.350
Correct! I mean, wait! It's a huge problem!
